{"id":"97a6f341b7a6e48c","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism.md","title":"Canonical Monoidal Morphism","display":"df-canonical-monoidal-morphism — Canonical Monoidal Morphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism","aliases":["93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism"],"display":"df-canonical-monoidal-morphism — Canonical Monoidal Morphism","depends_on":["[[71-df-monoidal-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-canonical-monoidal-morphism — Canonical Monoidal Morphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a href=\"?unresolved=71-df-monoidal-category\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-1\" data-link-target=\"71-df-monoidal-category\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">71-df-monoidal-category<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> is a six-component monoidal-category candidate; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}\">\\(\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}\\)</span> are the sourced monoidal-category predicate, object projection, and hom-family notation of <a href=\"?unresolved=71-df-monoidal-category\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-2\" data-link-target=\"71-df-monoidal-category\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">71-df-monoidal-category<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\">\\(\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Can}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Can}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}monoidal\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle:X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}monoidal\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle:X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}monoidal\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\langle1_X,X,X\\rangle:X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\alpha_{A,B,C},(A\\otimes B)\\otimes C,A\\otimes(B\\otimes C)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\alpha^{-1}_{A,B,C},A\\otimes(B\\otimes C),(A\\otimes B)\\otimes C\\rangle:\nA,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda_A,I\\otimes A,A\\rangle,\\langle\\lambda_A^{-1},A,I\\otimes A\\rangle,\n\\langle\\rho_A,A\\otimes I,A\\rangle,\\langle\\rho_A^{-1},A,A\\otimes I\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}monoidal\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\langle1_X,X,X\\rangle:X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\alpha_{A,B,C},(A\\otimes B)\\otimes C,A\\otimes(B\\otimes C)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\alpha^{-1}_{A,B,C},A\\otimes(B\\otimes C),(A\\otimes B)\\otimes C\\rangle:\nA,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda_A,I\\otimes A,A\\rangle,\\langle\\lambda_A^{-1},A,I\\otimes A\\rangle,\n\\langle\\rho_A,A\\otimes I,A\\rangle,\\langle\\rho_A^{-1},A,A\\otimes I\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}monoidal\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C):{}&amp;\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\subseteq R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle,\\langle g,X&#39;,Y&#39;\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle f\\otimes g,X\\otimes X&#39;,Y\\otimes Y&#39;\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle,\\langle g,Y,Z\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle g\\circ f,X,Z\\rangle\\in R\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}monoidal\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C):{}&amp;\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\subseteq R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle,\\langle g,X&#39;,Y&#39;\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle f\\otimes g,X\\otimes X&#39;,Y\\otimes Y&#39;\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle,\\langle g,Y,Z\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle g\\circ f,X,Z\\rangle\\in R\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}monoidal\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle\\in\n\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}monoidal\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle\\in\n\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The least-family construction makes “built from constraints” an object-level inductive closure rather than an undefined prose abbreviation. Every auxiliary constructor records all six monoidal components; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Can}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Can}_{93}\\)</span> then recovers those components from the code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"71-df-monoidal-category","status":"missing","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[71-df-monoidal-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"71-df-monoidal-category","status":"missing","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak M$ is a six-component monoidal-category candidate; $\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}$, $\\operatorname{Ob}$, and $\\operatorname{Hom}$ are the sourced monoidal-category predicate, object projection, and hom-family notation of [[71-df-monoidal-category]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Can}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}monoidal\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle:X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}monoidal\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\coloneqq{}&\n\\{\\langle1_X,X,X\\rangle:X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\alpha_{A,B,C},(A\\otimes B)\\otimes C,A\\otimes(B\\otimes C)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\alpha^{-1}_{A,B,C},A\\otimes(B\\otimes C),(A\\otimes B)\\otimes C\\rangle:\nA,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\lambda_A,I\\otimes A,A\\rangle,\\langle\\lambda_A^{-1},A,I\\otimes A\\rangle,\n\\langle\\rho_A,A\\otimes I,A\\rangle,\\langle\\rho_A^{-1},A,A\\otimes I\\rangle:\nA\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}monoidal\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ar}_{93}(\\mathcal C):{}&\n\\mathcal G_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\subseteq R\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle,\\langle g,X',Y'\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle f\\otimes g,X\\otimes X',Y\\otimes Y'\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle,\\langle g,Y,Z\\rangle\\in R\\;\n\\langle g\\circ f,X,Z\\rangle\\in R\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}monoidal\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\land\\langle f,X,Y\\rangle\\in\n\\operatorname{CanMor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Can}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false}],"bytes":2984,"backlinks":[{"id":"07f5930ce42abb03","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Can}_{93}(f,X,Y;\\mathfrak M)$ is the least canonical-morphism relation of [[93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-canonical-monoidal-morphism]]"}],"outgoing":[]}